Package: thunar
Version: @DEB_THUNAR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, libexo-2-0
Description: File manager for the Xfce desktop environment
 Thunar is the fast, lightweight Xfce file manager. Ships the thunar binary and
 the libthunarx-3 extension library. Built without gudev/libnotify (Linux-only),
 so removable-media mounting is unavailable; local browsing works.
